  "contentHtml": "<p>오늘&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">공문이 와서&nbsp;참고하시라고 올립니다.</span></p><p>공문에 의하면 고1 통합과학에 나오는 멸치해부도 일단은 해부 금지 대상이 맞습니다.</p><p><br></p><p>하지만, 아래 내용 중 3번 관련하여 학운위 통과 또는 학교장 승인 등의 개정내용을 넣어 조만간 시행규칙을 개정해서 공문으로 알려줄 예정이라 기다려 달라는 내용을&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">받았습니다. (농림축산식품부 동물복지과 통화내용)</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" ld=\"http://cfile283.uf.daum.net/attach/99AF613E5EEB1BA92AD93C\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 13.3333px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">&nbsp;미성년자 동물해부실습 금지대상동물.hwp</span><br></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br></span></div><p><br></p><div>-----</div><div><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: dotum; font-size: 13.3333px;\"><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">관련</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: dotum; font-size: 13.3333px;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">가</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">농림축산식품부 동물복지정책과</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">-1454(2020.6.12.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: dotum; font-size: 13.3333px;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">동물보호법 제</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">24</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">조의</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">미성년자 동물해부실습의 금지</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 19.6pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: dotum; font-size: 13.3333px; text-indent: -19.6pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">「</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">동물보호법</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">」</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">개정</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">('18.3.20</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">공포</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, '20.3.20</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">시행</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">에 따른&nbsp;</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">미성년자 동물해부실습의&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">금지</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">와 관련하여 농림축산식품부에서 안내한&nbsp;</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">동물해부실습 금지대상동물</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">을 붙임과</span><span  style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">같이 안내하오니 교육과정 운영에 참고하시기 바랍니다</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 19.4pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: dotum; font-size: 13.3333px; text-indent: -19.4pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">「</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">동물보호법</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">」&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">제</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">24</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">조의&nbsp;</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">단서조항에 따라 허용되는&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">「</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">초ㆍ중등교육법</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">」</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">제</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">조에</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">따른 학교 또는 동물실험시행기관 등이 시행하는 경우 등</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">에 대하여는</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -1.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -1.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">현재 시행규칙</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\">개정</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">중</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">법제처 심사 중</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">으로</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">개정내용이 확정된 후 공문으로 알릴 예정입니다</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 19.4pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: dotum; font-size: 13.3333px; text-indent: -19.4pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">관련문의</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">농림축산식품부 동물복지과&nbsp;</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">☎&nbsp;</span><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">044-201-2376)</span></p></div><div><span  style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
